</li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/el/about/" lang="el">Ελληνικά</a></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/ru/about/" lang="ru">Русский</a></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/zh/about/" lang="zh">中文</a></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/fr/about/" lang="fr">Français</a></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/hi/about/" lang="hi">हिन्दी</a></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/es/about/" lang="es">Español</a></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/tl/about/" lang="tl">Tagalog</a></li></ul></details></nav></div></header><main class="bc-main" id="main"><div class="bc-wrap bc-page bc-info"><h1>About Bible Corner</h1><p class="bc-lead">Bible Corner is a free Bible for everyone, made by Knowing Jesus Today, an Orthodox Christian website. You can read every book of the Bible, including the deuterocanonical books kept by the Orthodox Church, in more than 30 languages; search it; listen to it; and save it for reading offline. There are no ads and nothing tracks you. An account is never needed to read: it is only there if you want to keep notes, highlights and reading plans across your devices.</p><h2 class="bc-sub">The Bible in more than 30 languages</h2><ul class="bc-verlist"><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/" lang="en">English</a>: King James Version, with the deuterocanonical books <small>(Public Domain)</small></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/ar/" lang="ar">العربية</a>: ترجمة فاندايك <small>(Public Domain)</small></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/el/" lang="el">Ελληνικά</a>: Η Παλαιά Διαθήκη κατά τους Εβδομήκοντα και η Καινή Διαθήκη (βυζαντινό κείμενο) <small>(Public Domain · Psalms and Daniel aligned with Swete (CC BY-SA 4.0))</small></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/ru/" lang="ru">Русский</a>: Синодальный перевод <small>(Public Domain)</small></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/zh/" lang="zh">中文</a>: 和合本（简体） <small>(Public Domain)</small></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/fr/" lang="fr">Français</a>: Louis Segond 1910 <small>(Public Domain)</small></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/hi/" lang="hi">हिन्दी</a>: भारतीय संशोधित संस्करण (IRV) <small>(CC BY-SA 4.0)</small></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/es/" lang="es">Español</a>: Reina-Valera 1909 <small>(Public Domain)</small></li><li><a href="https://biblecorner.com/tl/" lang="tl">Tagalog</a>: Tagalog ULB (Unlocked Literal Bible) <small>(Redistribution source)</small></li></ul><p class="bc-lead">These nine have their own pages here. In the study reader you can choose from 130 translations in 57 languages.</p><p class="bc-lead">The full Orthodox canon: Including Tobit, Judith, Wisdom, Sirach, Baruch and the Maccabees.</p><aside class="kjtb-abthanks" data-kjt-notr aria-label="AndBible"><img src="https://biblecorner.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/AndBible-logo-300x300.jpg" alt="AndBible" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><p class="kjtb-abthanks__h">♥ With thanks to AndBible</p><p class="kjtb-abthanks__p">AndBible, the free and open-source Bible app, inspired the study tools of Bible Corner: Study Pads, labels, bookmarks and notes. Your AndBible study can come here, and go back to AndBible.</p><p class="kjtb-abthanks__b"><a href="https://andbible.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↗ Visit AndBible</a></p></div></aside><style>.kjtb-abthanks{display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:flex-start;margin:1rem 0;padding:.9rem 1rem;border:1px solid #e3d3a0;border-radius:16px;background:#fffdf6;color:#2a1a2c;text-align:start}.kjtb-abthanks img{flex:none;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px}.kjtb-abthanks p{margin:0}.kjtb-abthanks__h{font:700 1rem Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;color:#3e093f}.kjtb-abthanks__p{margin-top:.25rem!important;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.5;color:#504456}.kjtb-abthanks__b{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem;margin-top:.55rem!important}.kjtb-abthanks__b a,.kjtb-abthanks__b button{display:inline-block;padding:.35rem .8rem!important;border:1px solid #c9a